{"seq":33,"at":"2026-10-22","kind":"printed","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w25213"},"reason":"Printed on publish-or-perish-mge card ppm-016, category 2; the card's own words are kept in cardText — \"[Medical Sciences] What is melanin responsible for?\nA. Sleep\nB. Skin pigmentation\nC. Wound healing\nAnswer: B. Melanin is the natural pigment that gives our hair, skin, and eyes their color. It is also known to provide some protection against the effects of UV radiation. Generally, darker-skinned individuals have melanin that is more spread out in the skin, while lighter-skinned individuals have more clumped melanin.\".","by":"merge art/architecture, art/painting, art/sculpture, belief/mythology, belief/philosophy, belief/religion, earth-space/a","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/publish-or-perish-mge/ppm-016.json","changes":[{"field":"en","new":"Which natural pigment gives human hair, skin and eyes their colour and offers some protection against UV radiation?"},{"field":"de","new":"Welches natürliche Pigment verleiht menschlichem Haar, Haut und Augen ihre Farbe und schützt etwas vor UV-Strahlung?"},{"field":"origin","new":"printed"},{"field":"printed","new":{"source":"publish-or-perish-mge","card":"ppm-016","category":2}},{"field":"cardText","diff":[["+","[Medical Sciences] What is melanin responsible for?\nA. Sleep\nB. Skin pigmentation\nC. Wound healing\nAnswer: B. Melanin is the natural pigment that gives our hair, skin, and eyes their color. It is also known to provide some protection against the effects of UV radiation. Generally, darker-skinned individuals have melanin that is more spread out in the skin, while lighter-skinned individuals have more clumped melanin."]]},{"field":"fact","new":"f05204"}],"hash":"7f941e5595ad"},
